{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前TVB當家花旦郭可盈與林文龍於1995年因拍攝劇集《萬里長情》而結緣，拍拖9年後於2004年結婚，婚後育有一女林天若（Tania），一家三口幸福美滿。即將迎來57歲生日的郭可盈，日前獲前TVB金牌監製梅小青及劉家豪夫婦等提前慶生，梅小青在社交平台大曬多張慶生照，並大爆老公劉家豪正是郭可盈與林文龍的「媒人」！</p><figure><img alt=\"兩公婆好恩愛。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260501/1127013853855617024370491.jpeg/2OMZ-Muu2C9FZcu9xWzpKOwapH7sumkXQ3nHEEN5xxA\"/><figcaption>兩公婆好恩愛。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家三口溫馨合照。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260115/1088528908066230272930576.jpeg/7GV32t9jyl2oOfOXouvPSakJKb-eyhLVnl9k_Z5fZP0\"/><figcaption>一家三口溫馨合照。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同框似姊妹。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159490117921148928104537.jpeg/yLBBBqRQ7pvvspzigIVFWqab6a2fe3VtCE9nUwhPZ1M\"/><figcaption>同框似姊妹。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><p>郭可盈獲梅小青劉家豪提前慶生　大壽桃賀壽排場十足</p><p>相中所見，一眾好友聚首一堂舉杯暢飲，枱上擺放着一個特大「壽」字壽桃包拼盤，旁邊還有發光「Happy Birthday」字牌及拔絲甜品塔，儀式感十足。壽星女郭可盈一頭啡色長曲髮披肩，氣質優雅，皮膚白滑緊緻，狀態極佳。而身旁的林文龍則一身休閒型格打扮，兩公婆與梅小青及劉家豪夫婦相擁合照，畫面相當溫馨！</p><figure><img alt=\"好熱鬧！（IG@muisc927）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202283055793180672594167.jpeg/7vY7BRqDCb20-5lxWwdsYDWCjNZe5ho9nVRe_J1UXvw\"/><figcaption>好熱鬧！（IG@muisc927）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好熱鬧！（IG@muisc927）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202283053498765312914035.jpeg/Dqnx3JiNo2O6WPtkD5SnmE56dyf-Tnmw3jxt-948bfs\"/><figcaption>好熱鬧！（IG@muisc927）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梅小青大爆老公劉家豪是媒人。（IG@muisc927）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202283058058235904476502.jpeg/oD_ljFTFvsacFOF2k1VwjPV3HDJp481gdOCle3TgpXs\"/><figcaption>梅小青大爆老公劉家豪是媒人。（IG@muisc927）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"合作無間。（IG@muisc927）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202283050604564480798165.jpeg/pIbxuFNDRyFKQbqOgRgzfdgTb50s00Ri7lUjqe5VI6k\"/><figcaption>合作無間。（IG@muisc927）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"合作無間。（IG@muisc927）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202283047387402240389625.jpeg/aOuvWRMXGftguexhwVDHjTP7nM3pBcSDGX1wMxl9cDM\"/><figcaption>合作無間。（IG@muisc927）</figcaption></figure><p>梅小青爆老公劉家豪是媒人撮合良緣　合作多部經典劇集情誼深厚</p><p>梅小青感性重提與郭可盈及林文龍多年來的合作淵源，更大爆老公劉家豪是兩人的媒人：「緣份的天空💞每次與可盈和文龍合作都非常愉快🥰家豪哥還是他倆的媒人呢🥰開心同賀可盈生日快樂🎂所有親切感返曬嚟💖#青出於藍 #心花放 #人海綠皮書 #錦繡良緣 #法證先鋒」。其實郭可盈與林文龍當年拍攝《萬里長情》時，正是由劉家豪擔任監製，兩人因而戲假情真，其後郭可盈與林文龍亦分別主演過梅小青監製的《青出於藍》、《心花放》、《錦繡良緣》及《法證先鋒》等多部TVB經典劇集，雙方合作無間，結下超過三十年的深厚情誼！</p><figure><img alt=\"郭可盈與林文龍於1995年因拍攝劇集《萬里長情》而結緣。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202285634866122752610947.jpeg/RX7WmC-gVdboBO3KWhwTZbRQwk5Scq1XxDmBMcQ5gTE\"/><figcaption>郭可盈與林文龍於1995年因拍攝劇集《萬里長情》而結緣。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"恩愛如昔。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260819/1166706329474174976264085.jpeg/YMQ4QY5DRJSOFYYqHoD4A5uoKfbAAuDQrKdCn6ynQp8\"/><figcaption>恩愛如昔。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慶祝母親節。（IG@khy_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260617/1143982377521909760201863.jpeg/UjuE4VW2i6uDmqn-xaJpK1kh4yxEfhJpeD86mXg_Opk\"/><figcaption>慶祝母親節。（IG@khy_official）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T14:45:44.136070+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":876,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T15:37:20.528730+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:37:49.879840+00:00","content_hash":"c0600552c00dc383bd681634d3f6bdf2dd1923b1b9ccd9d3581640c6529859ca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}